# Curated builtin extension list for the static island interpreter (#672).
#
# This file is copied to Modules/Setup.local of the pinned CPython source
# tree by `scripts/build_static_cpython.py` before configure runs. Modules
# listed here are compiled into libpython instead of being built as shared
# objects under lib-dynload, which is what makes a single-file
# `--disable-shared` island binary possible: a default source build ships
# `math` (and friends) as `.so` files, and an island binary run without the
# build tree fails with "No module named 'math'".
#
# Semantics (Modules/makesetup): the first rule for a module wins and later
# rules are skipped with a warning, so a `*static*` block here overrides the
# shared builds that Modules/Setup.stdlib would otherwise generate. The flag
# variables (`MODULE_<NAME>_CFLAGS`/`_LDFLAGS`) are resolved from the Makefile
# configure generated, so `-lm` (math, cmath, _statistics, _datetime),
# `$SOCKET_LIBS` (_socket) and `$TIMEMODULE_LIB` (time) are carried over —
# each becomes a `LIBS` entry of the static link.
#
# Selection rule: every extension the island runtime's import closure can
# hit on a desktop/server target, and nothing that drags in an external
# library we would then have to ship or statically link twice. That means:
# no _ssl/_hashlib (OpenSSL), no _sqlite3, no readline, no curses, no
# _ctypes (libffi), no zlib/bz2/lzma/zstd (a stored stdlib zip needs no
# zlib, per the embedding plan; the pure `zlib`/`gzip` modules import but
# their compression backends stay missing, see the doc's divergence note).
# Add a row here only with a differential probe and a note in the PR; the
# list is intentionally short.
#
# Format: one `*static*` block, one module per line (name, source files under
# Modules/). See Modules/Setup.stdlib.in for the full catalogue of buildable
# modules and their flag requirements; this list tracks it per pinned micro.
*static*
array arraymodule.c
binascii binascii.c
cmath cmathmodule.c
math mathmodule.c
_statistics _statisticsmodule.c
_datetime _datetimemodule.c
_bisect _bisectmodule.c
_heapq _heapqmodule.c
_json _json.c
_pickle _pickle.c
_random _randommodule.c
_struct _struct.c
_zoneinfo _zoneinfo.c
_socket socketmodule.c
select selectmodule.c
unicodedata unicodedata.c
